omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vyZTUj9VIkMQ7kNvwHPaSOf&_nc_oc=Adq2iHN5mTkGsxYoz1ZQoi6q4RN6K0-1BBbB9WjPLT2sSJ7bXHwKeYG1OjYNzwdF3jg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxyPaRbqaD7Af49Y4OclJygW0kcQao6ML0OH4WNomvpyA&oe=69CE5174"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o8v1DNI60OAQ7kNvwElsPOg&_nc_oc=AdpTq7u2VoHny2qgsLovymnxH4g_OK9HOq1_lGGOERal4aKMz8fyKF-qC4MiWlj-VeE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyeBUbX7T3KervjDPcNHMucrTStwGSZHWkpq7vYGRySLw&oe=69CE52D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=svCj30hxt0MQ7kNvwEzbtdc&_nc_oc=Adq_heCEMiotAPOallECQFSRSAIJpqfDOjjSoouaaq6XgV1eGTw-Ncft-K8uT53Scas&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfysnYmfkc9YbdIeKpfp-EkmzmkXTGhZtHBqdhZITtKueQ&oe=69CE67F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://